      "Meta, like its Silicon Valley peers, has been rushing to sign deals for more AI computing power. Its largest effort — a nearly 4,000-acre campus in Louisiana — is set to provide up to 5 gigawatts of capacity.",
      "Crusoe, founded in 2018, specializes in building and running large data centers for AI work. It already has deals with Oracle Corp., Microsoft Corp. and Alphabet Inc.'s Google for three other data center campuses.",
